<title>UK: Venezuela sets $315 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Venezuela sets $315 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   VENEZUELA</p>
<p> AMT    $315 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    18.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE  L-17.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+265-270 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	BA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  B+	  DENOMS (K) 100+10    SALE LIMITS ++</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  VENEZUELA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    50 BP     SELL CONC  50 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND MAY 2007 U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p> NOTES   ++ REG S NOTES UNRESTRICTED GLOBAL. 144A RESTRICTED</p>
<p> GLOBAL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
